{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>首次到日本旅行，最怕在機場迷失方向、看不懂餐牌、點菜時有口難言。Yukitabi 是一款以離線使用為本的日本旅遊指南，把機場入境流程、飲食介紹、常用日語、賞櫻熱點與文化禮儀整理成隨身資料庫，適合初次赴日或不想臨場摸索的旅客。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-75.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線入境與點餐全攻略</h2>\n<p>由成田與羽田機場入境起，Yukitabi 逐步教你過關、開通 SIM 卡與購買 IC 卡。內置 30 多款日本料理介紹，附致敏原提示及日文點餐句；常用語設展示卡片模式，把手機遞給店員即可溝通。另有 16 個賞櫻熱點、禮儀貼士、可儲存進度的清單與 28 篇深入指南，離線亦可用。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-314-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-315-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-316-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-317-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-318-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-319-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Yukitabi</li><li>應用類別：Travel</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/yukitabi/id6765481152?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T21:40:13.876345+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T21:31:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T23:18:14.842623+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T21:38:06.749116+00:00","content_hash":"9c9ddbf88f28e39dd185cbd898a6ab0d913155e54c65cd9f6c538d30ece5b09f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}